    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Server</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>They can fart!</strong> But they can also jump, dash, shoot, plant seeds and glide across the stars. \u2604\ufe0f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To win the game, they must:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Find</strong> the seed,<br></li><li><strong>Bring</strong> the seed home,<br></li><li><strong>Plant</strong> the seed in one of the 3 bud holes on their home planet,<br></li><li><strong>Not be shot, squashed</strong> or <strong>launched</strong> into the infinite void of space.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739900/extras/23c914842cad1ebfcb096fc3b37c57ed.poster.avif?t=1718723827\" width=600 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739900/extras/23c914842cad1ebfcb096fc3b37c57ed.webm?t=1718723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Once the 3 seeds are planted and there's no empty bud hole on their planet, <strong>they win!</strong><br><br>Also, the planets are alive and their eyes <strong>are watching you.</strong> Yay! \ud83e\uddff\ud83e\ude90<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s inside:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer battle<br></li><li>2 to 6 players fights<br></li><li>Juicy gravity based moves<br></li><li>Weird lifeforms<br></li><li>Advanced fart simulation</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739900/extras/598a969f3fc82740712653b8cfc19e77.poster.avif?t=1718723827\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739900/extras/598a969f3fc82740712653b8cfc19e77.webm?t=1718723827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
